00:52:41.030 --> 00:52:45.510
Do not get the coffee from the truck because they make coffee as an afterthought.

1197
00:52:45.510 --> 00:52:48.810
Then there's craft services, which makes snacks and all that stuff.

1198
00:52:48.910 --> 00:52:50.650
But coffee is what they do.

1199
00:52:50.890 --> 00:52:52.190
That's what they're judged on.

