01:16:11.730 --> 01:16:14.330
So please eat crackers responsibly.

1632
01:16:15.750 --> 01:16:16.750
These are great.

1633
01:16:17.230 --> 01:16:18.030
So cute.

1634
01:16:18.330 --> 01:16:20.190
And he's so, like, sincere.

1635
01:16:20.450 --> 01:16:20.850
Yes.

